regulatory or legal developments in the United States and other countries;

developments or disputes concerning patent applications, issued patents or other proprietary rights of our collaborators;

the recruitment or departure of key personnel by us or our collaborators;

developments with respect to our existing collaboration agreements and announcements of new collaboration agreements;

